<urn:atm:triage:finding/INTG-FTQ-002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "INTG-FTQ-002" ;
  triage:title "Wall-clock timing assertion in watch_runtime_shutdown_returns_within_bounded_deadline" ;
  triage:description "watch_runtime.rs:582 — asserts shutdown_started.elapsed() < WATCH_SHUTDOWN_DEADLINE + 1s. On loaded CI runners the 100ms + 1s window can be exceeded. Fix: remove wall-clock assertion; functional proof is that shutdown() returns Ok(()) without hanging, not a sub-second budget." ;
